\ Regression test: building with --emit-runtime-image used to fail at
\ runtime with "skipping unsupported descriptor entry" notes for types
\ in lib/process.1z and lib/scanner.1z whose descriptors carry nested
\ maps, vectors, type-value references, or quotations. The freeze-time
\ descriptor walk could only encode symbol/boolean/fixnum/string/unit
\ values, so anything else was silently stripped and the rehydrated
\ TypeValues reached runtime without the metadata struct-field access,
\ variant lookup, and virtual wrap need.
use "process" ;
use "scanner" ;

"ok" print-line
